.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_voltage_measurement_start_data" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_voltage_measurement_start_data \- Start Voltage Measurements Data Structure
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_voltage_measurement_start_data {
.br
.BI "    __le16 lvolta;"
.br
.BI "    __le16 svmt;"
.br
.BI "    __le32 lvolt;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd8[4088];"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "lvolta" 12
Log Voltage Threshold Attributes, see \fIenum
nvme_voltage_measurement_lvolta\fP.
.IP "svmt" 12
Stop Voltage Measurement Time, in minutes. A value of 0h
specifies no stop measurement time value.
.IP "lvolt" 12
Log Voltage Threshold, see \fIenum nvme_voltage_measurement_lvolt\fP.
Ignored if the VMLT bit is cleared to '0' in \fIlvolta\fP.
.IP "rsvd8" 12
Reserved
